OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786475919
OL,3,CWhy is looking directly at a solar
OL,4,Ceclipse dangerous?
OL,6,FIn a rare case of eclipse eye damage,
OL,7,Fa woman who viewed an eclipse in North
OL,8,FAmerica in 2017 without adequate
OL,9,Fprotection complained of a black spot
OL,10,Fin her vision.
OL,12,FDoctors discovered retinal damage that
OL,13,Fcorresponded to the eclipse's shape.
OL,15,F"The dark spot she was describing was
OL,16,Fin the shape of a crescent," said Dr.
OL,17,FAvnish Deobhakta, a Mount Sinai
OL,18,Fophthalmologist.
OL,26,@wD@AOUxD@\O]
