OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786475919
OL,3,CWhy is looking directly at a solar
OL,4,Ceclipse dangerous?
OL,6,F"If you're purchasing specially made
OL,7,Feclipse glasses, make sure to double
OL,8,Fcheck that they are undamaged before
OL,9,Fuse as even a glimpse of damage could
OL,10,Fhave an impact on your eyesight," she
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,14,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,15,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,16,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,18,FShe also said it was a "myth" that
OL,19,Fwearing multiple pairs of sunglasses
OL,20,Fcan increase protection.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@aO]
