OL,3,CWhy is looking directly at a solar
OL,4,Ceclipse dangerous?
OL,6,FThe next time the Moon obscures as
OL,7,Fmuch of the Sun will be in 2081, and
OL,8,Fthe next total solar eclipse in the UK
OL,9,Fwill be in 2090.
OL,11,FThe maximum point of coverage is
OL,12,Fexpected to be at around 7.13pm.
OL,14,FBell advised getting to a vantage
OL,15,Fpoint facing west, with minimal
OL,16,Fbuildings around, as the best way to
OL,17,Fview the eclipse.
OL,19,FTo see where and when is the best time
OL,20,Fto watch it in the UK, click here
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/11
